{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788465567-WlwXpvwnAZ0FAIgSyEaj","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed: solara's `solara.render` in test mode does not render sidebar content into the returned tree — so buttons/sliders can't be reached that way. The repo's own tests work around this by rendering components directly (UserInputs in the main body) rather than through SolaraViz's sidebar.\n\nSo for interactive verification of ModelController's step/reset, I should render ModelController in the main body of a harness (not sidebar). The earlier event-loop error happened when rendering ModelController with `handle_error=False`. Why did it work inside SolaraViz? Because SolaraViz's ModelController is inside `solara.Sidebar()` — sidebar content isn't rendered by the test renderer at all (hence 0 Btn widgets). So use_task never ran.\n\nLet me test rendering ModelController directly with a running event loop, or check the use_task failure more carefully. `solara.lab.use_task` with `prefer_threaded=False` requires an event loop at mount. `solara.render` — maybe there's an option or context. Let me check how solara's own tests test use_task... Actually, there might be a way: run inside asyncio loop via `solara.util` or use `anyio.from_thread`. Let me check reacton's render — `reacton.core.render` might accept an event loop context.\n\nAlternative approach to still verify the changed behavior end-to-end for ModelController: render it inside an asyncio event loop context. Let me try wrapping in `asyncio.run(...)` won't help since solara.render is sync and called from within the loop... Actually it might work: if there IS a running event loop (asyncio.run(async fn) containing solara.render), then `get_running_loop()` succeeds. Let me try that.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Parasail","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9281beb7-8454-46da-9c7e-88efbd79f1a1","uuid":"32cf127b-b7ad-48d5-93a4-750748abb65a","timestamp":"2026-09-03T19:59:33.002Z","request_id":"gen-1788465567-WlwXpvwnAZ0FAIgSyEaj"}
